#: patterns/home.php:419
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:426
msgid "How does the Booknest book club work?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:427
msgid "Each month, we select a new book for our members to read. We start with a live discussion, share weekly posts for open conversations, and host interactive live sessions to explore comments. At the end of the month, we wrap up with a special live session to reflect on the book before moving on to the next one."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:432
msgid "Do I need to be an active participant to join?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:433
msgid "Not at all! You can engage as much or as little as you like. Whether you prefer reading along quietly, sharing your thoughts in the comments, or joining our live discussions, Booknest welcomes all kinds of readers."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:438
msgid "How are the books selected?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:439
msgid "Our selections balance literary classics, modern gems, and diverse genres to keep things fresh and engaging. Members can also suggest books, and we occasionally hold polls to let the community decide upcoming reads."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:444
msgid "Is there a membership fee?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/home.php:445
msgid "Booknest offers free and premium membership tiers. While free members can access book selections and discussions, premium members enjoy exclusive perks like extra content, private Q&amp;A sessions, and early event access."
msgstr ""

